<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Why should you still tarry, tarry,</l><l>Keep Him waiting there?</l><l>He is kind and gracious, gracious,</l><l>Merciful and dear.</l><l>Listen to His tender voice</l><l>Do not grieve His heart,</l><l>Won’t you let Him enter, enter,</l><l>And His grace impart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
